  "prefLabel": "He-C 201.09 Role of Department Staff in Hearings, Including Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 201.09 Role of Department Staff in Hearings, Including Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Department staff responsible for presenting the department’s case in any hearing, including enforcement or disciplinary hearings, except for those who are attorneys serving solely as department counsel in the hearing, shall be considered parties to the hearing.\n\nSource. #6986, eff 4-24-99; ss by #8866-A, eff 4-13-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c200.html"
